    <briefdescription>
<para>Hardware PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) driver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a high-level, object-oriented wrapper around the platform&apos;s hardware PWM port interface (<ref refid="syn__port__pwm_8h" kindref="compound">syn_port_pwm.h</ref>). Mirrors the pattern of <ref refid="syn__dac_8h" kindref="compound">syn_dac.h</ref>.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="structSYN__PWM" kindref="compound">SYN_PWM</ref><sp/>pwm;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="syn__pwm_8c_1ab8f1a7879ee1fe32d03b91a230735e84" kindref="member">syn_pwm_init</ref>(&amp;pwm,<sp/>0,<sp/>1000);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Channel<sp/>0<sp/>@<sp/>1<sp/>kHz</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="syn__pwm_8c_1a8212cef2f041feb5cbe18d64ca035010" kindref="member">syn_pwm_set_duty</ref>(&amp;pwm,<sp/>75);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>75%<sp/>duty<sp/>cycle</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="syn__pwm_8c_1a023a5b5f3fccc77b645e5eb1018c3fd5" kindref="member">syn_pwm_enable</ref>(&amp;pwm,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
